[- Binding: V. -]
[page id='binding-v'
  [meta
    title='V Binding'
    layout='reference'
    nav-order='610'
    audience='lookup'
    summary='V is the language libcx itself is written in. Direct calls, no FFI overhead.'
  ]

  [section id='install' title='Install'
    [code lang='shell' src='vpm install cx-lang']
  ]

  [section id='parse-emit' title='Parse and Emit'
    [code lang='v' src='''import cx

doc := cx.parse(input) or { panic(err) }
out := cx.emit_cx(doc)
xml := cx.to_xml(input)!
json := cx.to_json(input)!''']
  ]

  [section id='eval' title='Run a CXL Template'
    [code lang='v' src='''import cx

out := cx.eval_cxl(input_cx, program_cx, '') or { panic(err) }
println(out)''']
  ]

  [section id='include' title='Includes'
    [code lang='v' src='''import cx

doc := cx.parse_with_include_root(input, '/proj') or { panic(err) }
out := cx.eval_cxl_with_include_root(input, program, '', '/proj') or { panic(err) }''']
  ]

  [section id='canonical' title='Canonical Form and Identity'
    [code lang='v' src='''canonical := cx.cx_text_canonical(input)!
hash      := cx.cx_text_hash(input)!
eq        := cx.cx_text_eq(a, b)!''']
  ]

  [section id='native' title='V Native Variant'
    [prose The V binding ships in two shapes. The native variant (lang/v/native) calls into the cx package directly with no FFI — zero overhead, suitable for builds that statically link libcx. The cffi variant (lang/v/cffi) wraps the C ABI through V is C interop, useful when consuming a prebuilt libcx.dylib or libcx.so from a separate process.]
  ]

  [section id='related' title='Related'
    [list
      [item path='bindings/c-abi' label='C ABI — the layer V exposes to other bindings']
      [item path='bindings/index' label='Binding catalog']
    ]
  ]

  [preserve id='author-notes'
    [- Empty by default. -]
  ]
]
